      {
        "index": 1,
        "text": "In a college workshop, Amir developed a container intended to replace some disposable packaging. His first prototype looked promising, but appearance was not enough. He needed to find out whether the material could protect its contents during an ordinary delivery and whether customers could reuse it easily.",
