      {
        "index": 3,
        "text": "After several tests, one design performed better than the others. However, the sample was small, and durability under different conditions remained uncertain. Had he tested only the strongest container, his conclusion would have been misleading. He repeated the procedure and kept a record of unsuccessful attempts as well as successful ones.",
        "zh": "几轮测试后，一个设计表现优于其他设计。不过，样本较小，不同条件下的耐用性仍不确定。如果他只测试最坚固的容器，结论就会具有误导性。他重复了流程，也保留了失败和成功尝试的记录。",
