        "index": 4,
        "text": "The team then considered the environmental impact across the product's lifecycle. A reusable container still required resources to manufacture and transport. Amir decided that feasibility involved cost, convenience and likely reuse, not merely a successful demonstration. He presented the limitations openly and suggested further research before making a broad commercial claim.",
